    "properties": ["special", "thrown"],
    "range": "5/15 ft.",
    "specialDescription": "A Large or smaller creature hit by a net is restrained until freed. A net has no effect on formless creatures or creatures that are Huge or larger. A creature can use its action to make a DC 10 Strength check, freeing itself or another creature within reach on a success. Dealing 5 slashing damage to the net also frees the creature. When you use an action, bonus action, or reaction to attack with a net, you can make only one attack regardless of the number of attacks you can normally make."
